@startuml
!theme plain
title Project-wide Action Processing (gw:act)

actor "Maven" as Maven
participant "ActMojo" as Mojo
participant "ActProcessor" as Processor
participant "AI Engine" as AI
participant "User" as User

== Single Aggregator Execution ==

Maven -> Mojo: execute() at project root
activate Mojo

Mojo -> Mojo: Load configuration\n(serverId or config file)
Mojo -> Mojo: Apply parameters

Mojo -> Processor: Create processor\n(rooted at basedir)
activate Processor

Mojo -> Processor: Override getProjectLayout()
note right: Enriches with Maven\nreactor metadata

alt Interactive mode enabled
    Mojo -> Processor: Override input()\nfor Maven prompter
end

== Action Resolution ==

alt Act not provided
    Mojo -> User: Prompt for action
    User --> Mojo: Enter act name or\ndirect prompt (>...)
    Mojo -> Mojo: Save act in session\n(for module consistency)
else Act provided
    Mojo -> Mojo: Use configured act
end

Mojo -> Processor: Set act/prompt

== Processing Setup ==

alt Multi-module project with single reactor project
    Mojo -> Processor: Set non-recursive mode
end

alt Maven parallel build (-T N)
    Mojo -> Processor: Set thread count = N
end

Mojo -> Mojo: Initialize statistics
Mojo -> Mojo: Apply acts location\nand exclusions

== Scanning Phase ==

Mojo -> Mojo: Resolve scan path\n(default: basedir)

alt Maven project exists
    Mojo -> Mojo: Register class\nintrospection tools
end

Mojo -> Processor: Execute action\non project tree

Processor -> Processor: Load act definition\nor use direct prompt
Processor -> Processor: Discover all modules
Processor -> Processor: Process modules\n(children before parents)

loop For each discovered module
    Processor -> AI: Apply action\nto selected files
    AI --> Processor: Generate changes
    alt Interactive mode
        Processor -> User: Request confirmation\nor additional input
        User --> Processor: Provide input
    end
end

Processor --> Mojo: All modules complete

== Completion ==

alt Exit code = 0
    Mojo -> Mojo: Normal completion
else Exit code != 0
    Mojo -> Mojo: Throw termination error
end

Mojo -> Mojo: Log statistics
Mojo --> Maven: Execution complete

deactivate Processor
deactivate Mojo

@enduml